    "preamble": "Balaji Tipanna Karli vs The State Of Maharashtra on 30 October, 2023 Author: N.J.Jamadar Bench: N.J.Jamadar 8 aba 3011 of 2023.d In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Anticipatory Bail Application No.3011 Of 2023 Balaji Tipanna Karli ... Applicant versus State of Maharashtra ... Respondent Mr. Tanmay S. Karwa with Mr. Pranav Pokale, for Applicant. Mr. M.G.Patil, App for State. Coram: N.J.Jamadar, J. Date : 30 October 2023 2. This is an application for pre-arrest bail in connection with C.R.No.168 of 2023 registered with Chikhali Police Station for the offences punishable under Sections 188, 272, 273, 328 of IPC and Section 30(2)(a) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
